== PATCH 4: P0-E — Move Chart.js to end of body in rate-buydown-calculator.html ==

Chart.js is in <head> with no defer/async — blocks rendering.
Fix: move to end of body, before the existing <script> blocks.

FILE: rate-buydown-calculator.html

FIND in <head> section:
  <!-- Chart.js -->
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.3/dist/chart.umd.min.js"></script>

DELETE that line from <head>.

ADD at end of <body>, before the <script> containing buydown calculator code:
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.3/dist/chart.umd.min.js"></script>

NOTE: The DOMContentLoaded wrapper in the inline script means Chart.js will be loaded
before compute() is first called, so no timing issues.

