== PATCH 5: P0-C — Add aria-label to createSlider() in calculator-suite.js ==
== (REVIEW CAREFULLY — touches shared code used on 4 pages) ==

FILE: calculator-suite.js

FIND (line 73-74 in createSlider):
        '<input type="range" class="calc-slider-input" id="' + id + '" min="' + config.min + '" max="' + config.max + '" step="' + (config.step != null ? config.step : 1) + '" value="' + value + '">';

REPLACE WITH:
        '<input type="range" class="calc-slider-input" id="' + id + '" aria-label="' + (config.label || '') + '" min="' + config.min + '" max="' + config.max + '" step="' + (config.step != null ? config.step : 1) + '" value="' + value + '">';

This adds aria-label equal to the config.label string to every generated range input.

SECONDARY FIX: Also change the label span in createSlider to use <label> element for visual association:

FIND:
        '<div class="calc-slider-label">' +
          '<span>' + (config.label || '') + '</span>' +
          '<span class="calc-slider-value" data-value></span>' +
        '</div>' +

REPLACE WITH:
        '<div class="calc-slider-label">' +
          '<label for="' + id + '">' + (config.label || '') + '</label>' +
          '<span class="calc-slider-value" data-value></span>' +
        '</div>' +

